# Local checkouts of upstream repositories for the check-upstream skill.
#
# Copy this file to .env and set the path of each repository you have checked
# out. .env is not committed. check-upstream fetches into the checkout and
# reads it; it does not change the working tree or branches. A key with no
# value makes check-upstream clone the repository into a temporary directory.
#
# Key: UPSTREAM_<OWNER>_<REPO>, from the repository URL, in uppercase, with
# each character other than A-Z and 0-9 replaced by "_".
# Value: the absolute path of the checkout. On Windows, use forward slashes,
# for example G:/github/pronskiy-skills.

# https://github.com/pronskiy/skills (skills/reprompt)
UPSTREAM_PRONSKIY_SKILLS=

# https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail (skills/ponytail, skills/ponytail-review, skills/ponytail-audit, skills/ponytail-debt, skills/ponytail-gain, skills/ponytail-help)
UPSTREAM_DIETRICHGEBERT_PONYTAIL=

# https://github.com/tanweai/pua (skills/pua, skills/pua-en, skills/pua-ja, skills/pua-ding, skills/pua-mama, skills/pua-p7, skills/pua-p9, skills/pua-p10, skills/pua-pro, skills/pua-shot, skills/pua-yes)
UPSTREAM_TANWEAI_PUA=
